### Operator 交付车辆
POST http://localhost:5129/api/rental-orders/1026/items/1039/handover
Authorization: Bearer {{Operator2Token}}




### User 归还车辆
POST http://localhost:5129/api/rental-orders/1026/items/1039/return
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}


### Operator 领取车辆的验车任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/11/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{Operator2Token}}



### Operator 提交车辆验车通过
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/11/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{Operator2Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result": "Passed",
  "resultNotes": "Vehicle condition is normal."
}



### Operator 领取车辆的验车任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/4/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}



### Operator 提交车辆验车失败
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/4/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result": "Failed",
  "resultNotes": "Brake performance abnormal. Maintenance required."
}


### V3.3.8 Operator 领取车辆23维修任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/maintenances/2/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}


### V3.3.8 提交车辆23维修完成申请
